ndencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThe bug is a regression.\n- Reproducible in v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n- Not reproducible in v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce MX230 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8228) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1065G7 CPU @ 1.30GHz (8 threads) - 15.77 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe curve is closed, but the array of points shown in the inspector doesn't works as before with closed curves.\n \nThe first point misses the `In` control point and the last point misses the `Out` control point.\n\n<img width=\"354\" height=\"794\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c1dd4f9-9302-4efd-b58b-69a6d41c82fa\" />\n\nThis is the same Curve3D resource loaded in version 4.6.3:\n\n<img width=\"377\" height=\"824\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac874728-32be-45a8-a5f8-603a3cedb23c\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nReproduce the bug in a new project:\n1. Create a Path3D node.\n2. Add a Curve3D resource, \n3. Create some points for the curve\n4. Close the curve with the close curve button.\n\nReproduce the bug in the MRP:\n1. Open the project in the folder 4.7-stable.\n2. Open circle.tres in the Inspector tab.\n3. Display points array to watch first and last point in array.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[godot-4.7-curves3d-bug-master.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29403188/godot-4.7-curves3d-bug-master.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120681/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120681/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}